WEBVTT

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.490
and fear is all around us,

00:01:30.514 --> 00:01:32.378
we also have anti-fear.

00:01:33.085 --> 00:01:35.562
It's hard to imagine or measure.

00:01:35.586 --> 00:01:38.682
The background radiation
is simply too static

00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:42.209
to be able to be seen
under the normal spectral analysis.

00:01:42.929 --> 00:01:45.769
(American accent) But we feel
as though there are times

00:01:45.793 --> 00:01:48.246
when a lot of us --
you know what I'm saying?

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.114
But -- you know what I'm saying?

00:01:50.138 --> 00:01:52.677
Because, as a hip hop thing,
you know what I'm saying,

00:01:52.701 --> 00:01:54.962
TED be rocking --
you know what I'm saying.

00:01:54.986 --> 00:01:57.888
Like so I wrote a song,

00:01:57.912 --> 00:01:59.990
and I hope you guys dig it.